ls(Associate,Bachelor, High School, Doctorate, Master)\n","\n","person_income: Income of the loan applicant.\n","\n","person_emp_exp: Employment experience in years\n","\n","person_home_ownership: Housing situation (MORTGAGE, OWN, RENT, OTHER).\n","\n","loan_amnt: Amount of loan requested.\n","\n","loan_intent: Purpose of the loan (e.g., Education, Medical, Personal, Debt Consolidation, Venture, Home Renovation).\n","\n","loan_int_rate: Interest rate (%) applied to the loan.\n","\n","loan_percent_income: Ratio of loan amount to applicant's income (loan_amnt % person_income).\n","\n","cb_person_cred_hist_length:  Length of applicant's credit history (in years).\n","\n","credit_score: Applicant's credit score.\n","\n","previous_loan_defaults_on_file: Whether the applicant has defaulted on loans before (Yes/No).\n","\n","loan_status: Outcome of the loan application(0/1,(rejected/approved))\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"ufUhsKcWmLml"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Type of Analysis\n","\n","**Descriptive Analysis**\n","\n","   Used to summarize and describe the dataset.This analysis provides an overview on average applicant age, income and credit score.It shows the distribution of loan amounts and interest rates.\n","\n","**Diagnostic Analysis**\n","\n","   Investigates the dataset to uncover the various factors like the loan was rejected  because of low_income or low_credit_score and also deriving the possible reasons for the loan status\n","\n","**Predictive Analysis**\n","\n","   Based on the insights a lender can easily predict whether he should approve or cancel the loan, or a applicant can easily predict whether he can get the loan or not.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"wY6DmhBnmPng"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**Problem Definition:**\n","\n","Financial institutions face significant challenges in assessing loan applications due to the diversity of applicant profiles and the complexity of risk factors.\n","\n","The core problem is to analyze and interpret the dataset which provides demographic,financial and credit related data to uncover the factors that drive loan approval decisions, identify patterns of risk, and prepare the dataset for predictive modeling. This requires systematic data cleaning, preprocessing, exploratory data analysis (EDA), visualization, and diagnostic investigation to ensure that the dataset is reliable and insights are actionable.\n","\n","**Expected Outcome:**\n","\n","A clean, structured dataset suitable for analysis and modeling.\n","Descriptive insights into applicant profiles and loan characteristics.\n","Diagnostic findings highlighting influential factors such as credit score, loan-to-income ratio, and prior defaults.\n","Visual representations that make patterns and relationships easily interpretable.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"v5Nf1SpEmzRU"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## Dataset Selection\n","**Dataset Name**: Loan_Status\n","**Source**: Open ML, Dataset ID:46554\n","\n","**Dataset Size:**\n","\n","*   Rows: 45000\n","*   Columns:14\n","\n","**Features:**\n","The dataset includes:\n","Demographic details(person_age,person_gender,person_education,person_home_ownership,loan_intent,\n","previous_loan_defaults_on_file)\n","\n","Financial and credit related numerical data (Loan_amount, person_income, loan_int_rate, loan_percent_income, cb_person_cred_hist_length, credit_Score, loan_status)\n","\n","\n","\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"oP31ZgR6WMm4"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Importing libraries\n","import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import seaborn as sns"],"metadata":{"id":"Q3uZXh7ym646"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["file_id = \"1vY6KBxwNaiCdAdc35X1GjPoEyk-UEBK_\"\n","url = f\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/{file_id}/export?format=xlsx\"\n","\n","df= pd.read_excel(url)\n","df"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":443},"id":"vgtxaXdlZr97","executionInfo":{"status